// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 16
window.T16_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"bamboo – dim","cards":[{"w":"bamboo","p":"n.","d":"a tall tropical grass with hard, hollow stems used for building, furniture, or food","c":"竹子；竹竿（可數/不可數）","s":"Pandas in the wild depend almost entirely on eating tender green bamboo leaves to survive in the mountains.","t":"野外的熊貓幾乎完全依靠食用鮮嫩的綠色竹子葉在高山中生存。"},{"w":"bamboo shoot","p":"n.phr.","d":"the edible young sprout of the bamboo plant, used as a vegetable in cooking","c":"竹筍（可數）","s":"During the early spring rainy season, local farmers hike into the hills to dig up crispy bamboo shoots.","t":"在初春多雨的季節，當地農民徒步走進山丘挖掘清脆的竹筍。"},{"w":"client","p":"n.","d":"a person or organization using the professional services of a lawyer, accountant, or company","c":"委託人；客戶；訟務當事人（可數）","s":"The experienced defense attorney met privately with her client to discuss their defense strategy before the trial.","t":"經驗豐富的辯護律師在審判前與她的委託人／客戶私下會面以討論辯護策略。"},{"w":"customer","p":"n.","d":"a person who buys goods or services from a shop, store, or business","c":"顧客；買家（可數）","s":"Providing friendly and prompt customer service is the most effective way to retain shoppers in retail stores.","t":"提供親切且迅速的顧客服務是在零售店留住消費者的最有效方法。"},{"w":"consumer","p":"n.","d":"a person who purchases goods and services for personal use","c":"消費者（可數）","s":"Government agencies established strict regulations to protect consumer rights from misleading advertising campaigns.","t":"政府機構制定了嚴格的法規，以保護消費者權益不受誤導性廣告宣傳的侵害。"},{"w":"cone","p":"n.","d":"a solid or hollow object that tapers from a circular base to a point; a wafer container for ice cream","c":"圓錐體；甜筒；三角錐（可數）","s":"On a scorching summer afternoon, the little girl happily ate two scoops of chocolate gelato in a waffle cone.","t":"在炎熱的夏日午後，小女孩開心地吃著裝在威化甜筒裡的兩球巧克力義式冰淇淋。"},{"w":"constant","p":"adj.","d":"occurring continuously over a period of time; remaining unchanging","c":"持續不斷的；始終如一的；恆定的","s":"Residents living right next to the busy highway often complain about the constant noise of speeding trucks.","t":"住在繁忙公路旁的居民經常抱怨疾駛卡車所帶來的持續不斷的噪音。"},{"w":"constantly","p":"adv.","d":"continuously over a period of time; always or repeatedly","c":"不斷地；時常地；時時刻刻","s":"In our fast-paced modern world, digital information and smartphone software apps are constantly changing and updating.","t":"在我們快節奏的現代世界中，數位資訊與智慧型手機應用程式不斷地改變和更新。"},{"w":"controller","p":"n.","d":"a person who directs or regulates something; a handheld device used to operate games or machines","c":"控制器；管制員；主計官（可數）","s":"The teenage boy grabbed his wireless game controller and spent two hours playing an exciting racing game with his friend.","t":"那位青少年男孩拿起他的無線遊戲控制器／手把，花兩個小時和朋友玩了一場刺激的賽車遊戲。"},{"w":"crawl","p":"v.","d":"to move forward on hands and knees or by dragging the body close to the ground","c":"爬行；緩慢移動（動詞）","s":"The ten-month-old infant learned how to crawl across the carpeted living room floor to reach her favorite doll.","t":"十個月大的嬰兒學會了如何在鋪有地毯的客廳地板上爬行，以搆到她最喜歡的洋娃娃。"},{"w":"crawl with","p":"v.phr.","d":"to be filled or overrun with an unpleasantly large number of people or things","c":"擠滿；到處都是（動詞片語）","s":"On sunny holiday weekends, the picturesque coastal town is completely crawling with curious foreign tourists.","t":"在陽光明媚的假日週末，這座風景如畫的濱海小鎮完全擠滿了好奇的外國遊客。"},{"w":"dairy","p":"n.","d":"a building or company where milk and cream are stored or made into butter and cheese","c":"乳品廠；酪農場（可數）","s":"The school children took an educational bus field trip to visit a famous local dairy outside the countryside.","t":"學童們搭乘校車進行戶外教學，參觀鄉村外著名的當地乳品廠。"},{"w":"dairy","p":"adj.","d":"containing or made from milk, or involving milk production","c":"乳製品的；酪農業的","s":"People who suffer from severe lactose intolerance must strictly avoid consuming butter, cheese, and other dairy products.","t":"患有嚴重乳糖不耐症的人必須嚴格避免食用奶油、起司和其他乳製品。"},{"w":"dim","p":"adj.","d":"not shining brightly or clearly; dark or indistinct","c":"昏暗的；模糊的；前景黯淡的","s":"You should not strain your eyes by attempting to read small text in a dim room without adequate lighting.","t":"你不應該在缺乏充足光線的昏暗房間裡試圖閱讀細小文字而傷眼。"},{"w":"dim","p":"v.","d":"to make or become less bright, clear, or distinct","c":"使變暗；漸漸變暗；使模糊（動詞）","s":"The thoughtful cinema staff slowly dimmed the ceiling lights just before the feature movie began playing on the big screen.","t":"正片在銀幕上播放前，貼心的電影院工作人員緩緩調暗了天花板上的燈光。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"greenhouse – mob","cards":[{"w":"greenhouse","p":"n.","d":"a glass building in which plants that need protection from cold weather are grown","c":"溫室；暖房（可數）","s":"By cultivating delicate tomatoes inside a climate-controlled glass greenhouse, the organic farmer can harvest fresh produce year-round.","t":"透過在溫控玻璃溫室內培育嬌嫩的番茄，這位有機農夫一年四季都能採收新鮮農產。"},{"w":"industrial","p":"adj.","d":"relating to, or used in industry, manufacturing, or factories","c":"工業的；產業的；製造業的","s":"During the eighteenth century, the historic industrial Revolution fundamentally transformed agricultural societies into modern economies.","t":"十八世紀期間，歷史性的工業革命從根本上將農業社會轉變為現代經濟體。"},{"w":"industry","p":"n.","d":"economic activity concerned with the processing of raw materials and manufacture of goods","c":"工業；行業；勤勉（可數/不可數）","s":"Taiwan's high-tech semiconductor industry plays a pivotal role in supplying microchips to electronics companies worldwide.","t":"台灣高科技半導體產業／工業在為全球電子企業供應晶片方面發揮了關鍵作用。"},{"w":"ivory","p":"n.","d":"a hard creamy-white substance composing the main part of the tusks of an elephant or walrus","c":"象牙；象牙製品（不可數）","s":"International wildlife conservation agreements strictly prohibit the commercial trading of poached elephant ivory across all borders.","t":"國際野生動物保育公約嚴格禁止跨國非法盜獵大象牙的商業貿易。"},{"w":"ivory","p":"adj.","d":"having a creamy-white color like that of ivory","c":"象牙色的；乳白色的","s":"The bride looked breathtakingly elegant as she walked down the church aisle in a stunning ivory silk gown.","t":"新娘身穿驚豔的象牙色絲綢禮服走過教堂走道，顯得無比高雅。"},{"w":"jelly","p":"n.","d":"a sweet, clear, semi-solid food made with fruit juice and gelatin","c":"果凍；果醬（可數/不可數）","s":"American schoolchildren often pack classic peanut butter and grape jelly sandwiches into their school lunchboxes.","t":"美國學童經常把經典的花生醬配葡萄果醬三明治裝進學校便當盒裡。"},{"w":"knot","p":"n.","d":"a fastening made by tying a piece of string, rope, or cloth","c":"結；繩結；樹結（可數）","s":"Before hoisting the heavy sails on the boat, the experienced sailor tied a firm nautical knot in the rope.","t":"在船上升起沉重的帆之前，經驗豐富的水手在繩索上打了一個牢固的水手結。"},{"w":"tie the knot","p":"v.phr.","d":"an informal idiom meaning to get married","c":"結為連理；結婚（俚語）","s":"After dating happily for more than seven years, the devoted couple finally decided to tie the knot in Hawaii next summer.","t":"在愉快地交往七年多之後，這對專一的情侶終於決定明年夏天在夏威夷結為連理／結婚。"},{"w":"lobby","p":"n.","d":"a room providing a space out of which one or more other rooms lead; an entrance hall","c":"大廳；門廳；遊說團體（可數）","s":"Environmental protection groups formed a powerful political lobby to urge lawmakers to pass cleaner energy laws.","t":"環境保護團體組成了強大的政治遊說集團，敦促立法者通過更潔淨的能源法案。"},{"w":"missing","p":"adj.","d":"not present or not able to be found; lost","c":"失蹤的；找不到的；遺漏的","s":"Local police officers and volunteers searched the dense mountain forest all night trying to locate the missing child.","t":"當地警員與志工整夜在茂密的山林中搜索，試圖尋找那名失蹤的孩子。"},{"w":"mob","p":"n.","d":"a large crowd of people, especially one that is disorderly and intent on causing trouble","c":"暴民；烏合之眾；犯罪黑幫（可數）","s":"Riot police with heavy shields were dispatched downtown to disperse an angry mob that was smashing shop windows.","t":"手持重型盾牌的防暴警察被派往市中心，以驅散正在砸毀商店櫥窗的憤怒暴民。"},{"w":"mob","p":"v.","d":"to crowd around someone in an unruly and excited way","c":"蜂擁而上；圍堵；團團圍住（動詞）","s":"As soon as the world-famous pop idol stepped out of the private terminal, he was completely mobbed by cheering teenage fans.","t":"那位世界聞名的流行偶像一走出私人航廈，便立刻被歡呼的青少年粉絲團團包圍。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"monster – shrimp","cards":[{"w":"monster","p":"n.","d":"an imaginary creature that is typically large, ugly, and frightening; something extraordinarily large","c":"怪物；怪獸；極其龐大之物（可數）","s":"When the lights were turned off at bedtime, the imaginative boy worried that a scary green monster was hiding in the closet.","t":"睡覺關燈時，富有想像力的男孩擔心一隻可怕的綠色怪物正藏在衣櫥裡。"},{"w":"murder","p":"n.","d":"the unlawful premeditated killing of one human being by another","c":"謀殺；謀殺案（可數/不可數）","s":"Veteran homicide detectives worked around the clock at the crime scene to solve the mysterious downtown murder.","t":"資深兇殺案偵探在犯罪現場日以繼夜地工作，以偵破這起神秘的市中心謀殺案。"},{"w":"murder","p":"v.","d":"to kill someone unlawfully with premeditation","c":"謀殺；殘殺（動詞）","s":"The ruthless criminal was sentenced to life imprisonment after confessing that he had murdered his wealthy business partner.","t":"這名冷酷的罪犯在承認自己謀殺了富有的商業合夥人後被判處終身監禁。"},{"w":"parade","p":"n.","d":"a public procession, especially one celebrating a special day or event","c":"遊行；行列（可數）","s":"Excited children cheered and caught sweet candy thrown from colorful floats during the annual city holiday parade.","t":"在一年一度的城市節日大遊行中，興奮的孩子們歡呼並接住從多彩花車上拋下的甜糖。"},{"w":"rain on one's parade","p":"v.phr.","d":"to spoil someone's pleasure, plans, or excitement","c":"潑冷水；掃某人的興；煞風景（成語）","s":"I do not want to rain on your parade, but the weather forecast predicts heavy thunderstorms throughout your weekend beach trip.","t":"我不想潑你冷水／掃你的興，但天氣預報預測你整個週末海灘之旅都會有強烈雷雨。"},{"w":"parade","p":"v.","d":"to walk or march in a procession; to display proudly or ostentatiously","c":"遊行；炫耀（動詞）","s":"Modest people rarely feel the need to parade their personal wealth or designer clothes in front of colleagues.","t":"謙遜的人很少覺得有必要在同事面前炫耀他們的個人財富或名牌服飾。"},{"w":"pit","p":"n.","d":"a large hole in the ground; a hard stone inside a fruit like a peach","c":"深坑；礦坑；果核（桃、櫻桃等，可數）","s":"Construction workers operated heavy yellow bulldozers to dig a fifty-foot pit for the new skyscraper foundation.","t":"建築工人操作重型黃色推土機，為新摩天大樓地基挖掘了一個五十英尺的深坑。"},{"w":"promote","p":"v.","d":"to support or encourage; to raise someone to a higher position or rank","c":"促進；推廣；升職；提拔（動詞）","s":"Health organizations launch nationwide fitness campaigns to promote regular exercise and balanced nutrition among teenagers.","t":"衛生組織發起全國性的健身運動，以促進／推廣青少年的規律運動與均衡營養。"},{"w":"promotion","p":"n.","d":"activity that supports or encourages a cause, venture, or product; advancement in rank","c":"促銷；宣傳；升遷；晉升（可數/不可數）","s":"After five years of dedicated hard work at the accounting firm, David finally earned a well-deserved promotion to senior partner.","t":"在會計師事務所辛勤奉獻了五年之後，大衛終於獲得了實至名歸的晉升／升遷成為資深合夥人。"},{"w":"screw","p":"n.","d":"a short, slender, sharp-pointed metal pin with a raised helical thread used to join things","c":"螺絲釘；螺絲（可數）","s":"His bizarre and erratic behavior in the meeting made several coworkers wonder if he had a screw loose.","t":"他在會議上怪異且反覆無常的舉止讓幾位同事懷疑他是不是腦筋有點不對勁／神經短路。"},{"w":"screw","p":"v.","d":"to fasten or tighten with a screw; to twist or turn something","c":"用螺絲擰緊；旋轉扭緊（動詞）","s":"If you prepare thoroughly and stay calm during the job interview, you will definitely not screw up the opportunity.","t":"如果你在工作面試中做好充分準備並保持冷靜，你絕對不會搞砸這個機會。"},{"w":"scrub","p":"v.","d":"to rub someone or something hard so as to clean them, typically with a brush and water","c":"用力擦洗；刷洗（動詞）","s":"Before performing delicate surgery in the operating room, doctors must scrub their hands and arms thoroughly with antiseptic soap.","t":"在手術室執行精密手術之前，醫生必須用消毒皂徹底刷洗他們的雙手與手臂。"},{"w":"scrub","p":"n.","d":"an act of rubbing something hard to clean it; a cosmetic preparation applied to skin","c":"刷洗；磨砂膏；灌木叢（可數/不可數）","s":"The dirty white bathtub was covered in soap stains, so it definitely needed a good, vigorous scrub with bleach.","t":"髒兮兮的白色浴缸上沾滿了肥皂污漬，因此絕對需要用漂白水好好用力刷洗一番。"},{"w":"shrimp","p":"n.","d":"a small free-swimming crustacean with an elongated body, highly prized as seafood (pl. shrimp or shrimps)","c":"蝦；蝦子（可數/不可數）","s":"Whenever our family visits the seaside night market, we love ordering plates of crispy fried shrimp with garlic dipping sauce.","t":"每當我們全家造訪海濱夜市時，我們總喜愛點幾盤搭配大蒜沾醬的酥脆炸蝦。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"sorrow – unity","cards":[{"w":"sorrow","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of deep distress caused by loss, disappointment, or other misfortune","c":"悲傷；悲痛；令人悲傷之事（不可數/可數）","s":"The sudden and untimely passing of the beloved community doctor filled the entire neighborhood with profound sorrow.","t":"備受敬愛的社區醫生突然且過早的逝世，讓整個社區充滿了深沉的悲痛。"},{"w":"sorrowful","p":"adj.","d":"feeling or showing grief; causing sadness or distress","c":"悲傷的；悲哀的；令人傷心的","s":"Looking into the frightened rescue dog's gentle and sorrowful eyes, Kelly decided immediately to adopt him into her family.","t":"看著那隻受驚嚇的救援犬溫柔而悲傷的眼神，凱莉當下決定收養牠成為家庭的一員。"},{"w":"stitch","p":"n.","d":"a loop of thread or yarn resulting from a single pass or movement of the needle in sewing or medical repair","c":"一針；針腳；縫線（傷口）（可數）","s":"Remember that a stitch in time saves nine, so addressing minor car engine problems early will prevent costly breakdowns.","t":"切記及時一針省後九針（防微杜漸），及早解決微小的汽車發動機問題將能預防代價高昂的拋錨故障。"},{"w":"stitch","p":"v.","d":"to make, mend, or join with stitches","c":"縫合；縫補；繡（動詞）","s":"The emergency room doctor skillfully stitched up the deep gash on the young soccer player's knee with surgical thread.","t":"急診室醫生用手術縫線熟練地縫合了那位年輕足球員膝蓋上的深長傷口。"},{"w":"stubborn","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing dogged determination not to change one's attitude or position on something; difficult to move or cure","c":"頑固的；固執的；難以對付的","s":"Despite hours of patient reasoning from his parents, the stubborn teenager refused to admit his mistake or apologize to his sister.","t":"儘管父母進行了數小時的耐心說理，那名固執的青少年仍拒絕承認錯誤或向妹妹道歉。"},{"w":"studio","p":"n.","d":"a room where an artist, photographer, or musician works; a place where television or radio shows are recorded","c":"工作室；攝影棚；播音室；錄音室（可數）","s":"The famous rock band spent four intense months inside the London recording studio working on their brand-new album.","t":"這支著名的搖滾樂團在倫敦的錄音室裡度過了緊張的四個月，創作他們的全新專輯。"},{"w":"tower","p":"n.","d":"a tall, narrow building, either freestanding or forming part of a building such as a church or castle","c":"塔；高樓；高塔（可數）","s":"Rising majestically beside the Seine River, the iconic iron Eiffel Tower is one of the most visited monuments in the world.","t":"座落在塞納河畔巍峨聳立的標誌性鐵製艾菲爾鐵塔，是世界上造訪人數最多的紀念建築之一。"},{"w":"tower","p":"v.","d":"to rise to or reach a great height","c":"高聳；屹立；超越（動詞）","s":"During the family's sudden crisis, my calm older sister was a true tower of strength who helped everyone stay organized.","t":"在家族面臨突如其來的危機時，我沉著的姐姐是一位真正的中流砥柱，協助大家保持條理不亂。"},{"w":"underwear","p":"n.","d":"clothing worn under other clothes, typically next to the skin","c":"內衣；內褲（不可數集合名詞）","s":"Before embarking on their week-long summer camping trek, the boy made sure to pack plenty of clean underwear.","t":"在展開為期一週的夏季露營徒步之旅前，男孩確保打包了足夠的乾淨內衣褲。"},{"w":"union","p":"n.","d":"the action or fact of joining or being joined; an organized association of workers formed to protect their rights","c":"工會；聯合；同盟；婚姻結合（可數/不可數）","s":"Railway workers represented by the national labor union organized a peaceful strike to demand safer working conditions and fair wages.","t":"由全國勞工工會代表的鐵路員工發起了一場和平罷工，要求更安全的工作環境與合理工資。"},{"w":"unite","p":"v.","d":"to come or bring together for a common purpose or action","c":"團結；聯合；統一（動詞）","s":"In times of unprecedented natural disasters, community members often unite closely to provide food and shelter to displaced neighbors.","t":"在面臨前所未有的自然災害時，社區成員往往緊密團結，為流離失所的鄰舍提供食物與庇護所。"},{"w":"unity","p":"n.","d":"the state of being united or joined as a whole","c":"團結；統一；一致性（不可數）","s":"Playing team sports at school teaches young students the vital importance of cooperation, trust, and team unity.","t":"在學校參與團隊運動教會了年輕學子合作、信任與團隊團結的至關重要性。"}]}];
